    "body": "DUNCAN PRIME / SINGLE PRODUCT STREAM R02 — RESULT / DELTA / EVIDENCE / NEXT\n\nRESULT\n- Fresh state guard enforced against current #251 reset authority comment 5506451195.\n- Retired synthetic W01/Krita/ComfyUI execution is not being promoted as current product work.\n- local-executor PR #15 was closed without merge; its generated arms-down output remains historical FAIL evidence only.\n\nDELTA\n- Current `duncan/zorr-studio-r01` HEAD = `bb4e752bae839ecd13ebb352f12f8497f44eb9e5` (`studio: reset S001 contract around real shot intent`).\n- `studio/S001_SHOT_CONTRACT_R01.md` is now R02 and explicitly identifies the first real S001 blocker:\n  `S001_SHOT_INTENT / STORY_BEAT / ACTION_POSE = NOT_PROVEN`.\n- Exact durable S001 story beat, character action/pose target, primary visual read, and emotional/psychological pressure are not proven.\n- Technical contract fields (framing/raster/FPS/camera/depth/source package) are downstream of that product decision and must not be invented to fill the vacuum.\n\nEVIDENCE\n- #251 = one active product/master stream; active objective = FIRST_REAL_PRODUCTION_KEY_DRAWING / SCENE-BOUND POSE CANDIDATE.\n- #245 locked character model remains reusable foundation.\n- #248 remains supporting/on-demand mechanics QC only.\n- former #250 camera/S001 PREP remains reusable evidence only.\n- current studio HEAD `bb4e752...` explicitly forbids substituting synthetic W01, Krita/source-binding proof, OpenToonz install work, generic camera dynamics, or old smoke defaults for missing shot intent.\n\nSTATE\n`FIRST_REAL_PRODUCT_BLOCKER = S001_SHOT_INTENT / STORY_BEAT / ACTION_POSE_NOT_PROVEN`\n`FIRST_REAL_PRODUCTION_KEY_DRAWING = NOT_PRODUCED / NOT_SELECTED`\n`S001_PHYSICAL_BUILD_AUTHORITY = NO`\n`PASS = NOT_CLAIMED`\n\nNEXT\nOWNER authority is required for one product decision only: define the first real S001 shot intent at minimum as `STORY_BEAT + CHARACTER_ACTION/POSE + PRIMARY_READ + EMOTIONAL_PRESSURE` (or durably identify an already-existing real shot/key artifact that embodies it). After that, DUNCAN can produce/select exactly one scene-bound key candidate, obtain applicable image-execution authority if new pixels are required, then apply only the relevant identity/body/costume/pose/camera QC.\n\nFORBIDDEN UNTIL THEN\n- inventing a synthetic W01 frame as product work;\n- reopening source/Krita/OpenToonz/runtime research;\n- guessing S001 story/camera values;\n- new parallel product route;\n- PASS/canon/main promotion.",
